<title>SPAIN: Lead manager says Telepizza IPO six times overbid.</title>
<headline>Lead manager says Telepizza IPO six times overbid.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish pizza delivery chain Telepizza's initial public offering has so far been oversubscribed six times, lead manager BBV Interactivos said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Total demand for shares has reached 60 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>The subscription period for both the retail and instutional tranches ends on November 8. Telepizza is expected to be listed on the Madrid stock market for the first time on November 13.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
